### get_package_dir

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ get_package_dir { workspace_root target name hash } =\n    := dir = workspace_root </> \"target/spiral\" </> name\n    ?= hash, (target : option package_target) ?|\n    | Some hash, Some target => dir </> \"packages\" </> (target |> reflection.union_to_string) </> hash\n    | _ => dir","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ get_package_dir { workspace_root target name hash } =
      := dir = workspace_root </> "target/spiral" </> name
      ?= hash, (target : option package_target) ?|
      | Some hash, Some target => dir </> "packages" </> (target |> reflection.union_to_string) </> hash
      | _ => dir
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

