### block

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":== block =\n    {\n        magic : magic\n        content : () -> string\n    }\n\n:= block () =\n    trace Verbose (\\ () => \"spiral.block\") (\\ () => {})\n    pipe2\n        (magic_command ())\n        (content ())\n        \\ magic, content =>\n            trace Verbose (\\ () => \"spiral.block\") (\\ () => { magic })\n            := magic, content =\n                ?= magic () ?|\n                | \"fsharp\" => Fsharp, content\n                | \"markdown\" => Markdown, content\n                | \"spiral\" =>\n                    := content = content ()\n                    := output =\n                        ? content |> sm'.contains \"///- \" && content |> sm'.contains (\" --\" ++# \"real\")\n                        ?> Spir\n                        |: Spi\n                    output |> Spiral, \\ () => content\n                | magic => magic |> Magic, content\n            {\n                magic = magic\n                content = content\n            }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :== block =
      {
          magic : magic
          content : () -> string
      }

  := block () =
      trace Verbose (\ () => "spiral.block") (\ () => {})
      pipe2
          (magic_command ())
          (content ())
          \ magic, content =>
              trace Verbose (\ () => "spiral.block") (\ () => { magic })
              := magic, content =
                  ?= magic () ?|
                  | "fsharp" => Fsharp, content
                  | "markdown" => Markdown, content
                  | "spiral" =>
                      := content = content ()
                      := output =
                          ? content |> sm'.contains "///- " && content |> sm'.contains (" --" ++# "real")
                          ?> Spir
                          |: Spi
                      output |> Spiral, \ () => content
                  | magic => magic |> Magic, content
              {
                  magic = magic
                  content = content
              }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

